{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_002_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7301b95c7282804360f2eab1e51d3d96d96adf689905edc7ddb2e91babc72c96",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcac364175ea5172cb4ff83a476e7493e63cc633a4f17891f348a1cec394bc36",
      "text": "我果然擅长被人宠爱呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c57dd9bc280573bd3abac1dc063ad6b1354674d17100d8840c9eff92b14959",
      "text": "翔太决定出演一档从家人口中听取童年轶事、\n并结合照片等内容畅谈的节目。\n为此，他向家人打听了各种回忆故事，\n并收集起小时候的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcac364175ea5172cb4ff83a476e7493e63cc633a4f17891f348a1cec394bc36",
      "text": "我果然擅长被人宠爱呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb83259120c374985bc13ec80de748b6f9e458c9f6ef39fcb093cb956d861323",
      "text": "制作人！\n下次的工作是什么样的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4752102a8e226e9102cd743b19306fa2c4a801b231bc00ba2535f8c8d82a16d",
      "text": "是一档结合家人提供的照片与家庭录像，\n讲述童年轶事的节目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41327bcb5e65e4bc76e017000cc0a70f4f0836c42c691de2beb36fcb2a8e9044",
      "text": "希望翔太先生能向家人打听一些故事，\n并向家人转达出演节目相关的通知。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b88864f3db77d4919e9ae55afdcb49b151e0d591f810ce3fb220b212d7ae7f2",
      "text": "参与出演的人员，\n由我来另外进行详细说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a065db83a15c65c8e0cb51a980af4b1ea7d78ddd906d7e9cd7c806c819f7ec",
      "text": "哇～！听起来好有趣！\n我知道了！这就去问问看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6a0fa1c22ca1b4c71304d6868613f880587cd55973b90bb908d1f57e061233",
      "text": "电视机前的大家说不定会被我小时候的可爱模样\n迷得神魂颠倒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd405c1ed1ba1bbea5d803b6b5c8236804d0e40de1a5eb3ae73447a976b15b5",
      "text": "我也很期待看到翔太先生小时候的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d70af1240375237806de8e83b83eff9d35c52ef28e8ac83b8f078729887670a5",
      "text": "照片和录像都有好多好多，\n你就好好期待吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1642d8ede2878b2225c5caa422a4480180f3b6f1bb27cc76c80ee5407c7aea",
      "text": "有趣的故事肯定也有很多！\n姐姐们经常说的就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a8e241b8bb4227171ddd48cb51d3201cbe6566dd88028b4b2e734dcb7d9963a",
      "text": "哎呀，这个还是留到下次当惊喜比较好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_002sht_01_1_2_002_01:1_2_002_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85ac62be460be2d4e0bdfa72d3c829256bf71597561bbd79408cac670b1d08b0",
      "text": "那，我回去问问大家看喽～。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
